From ec71fa6f156f934e8d02e31ae8fffe09424072b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:44:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Write each month's ADS kit lines into the Ops Hub wo_log
 (rule 5.7)

buildEOM now fills wo_log columns Date, Quantity, SKU and Cost (A, B, C, G)
from the work-order report's kit lines. Rows dated in the month are replaced,
so re-runs never double them; other months and columns D-F are untouched.
Validated before any change; written after the workbook; result on Checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
